      "body": "**<sub><sub>![P1 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P1-orange?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Fence end against in-flight calls**\n\nWhen `end` races with `enter`/`resume` while an incomplete call has no currently unresolved invocation—for example after `call_started` but before `navigator_started`, or between Navigator settlement and role reservation—this check passes and publishes `ended`. The running path does not recheck the end marker in `fenceLaunch`, so it can subsequently launch Navigator or the selected role after status already reports the run ended. Treat any active incomplete call as non-endable and make `ended` and `call_started` mutually exclusive during conflict reconciliation.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.",
