      "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Preserve label-policy mappings in the snapshot**\n\nFor any non-empty `acquisition.labelPolicy`, acquisition validates and digests the mapping but drops it when constructing `CurrentPositionSnapshotV1`. Navigator therefore receives only raw label IDs/names and cannot use the caller-supplied typed meanings when recommending the next process, even though changing the mapping advances the cursor. Include the mapping in the digest-bound snapshot or admitted evidence so the consultation can actually apply it.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.",
