      "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Classify Judge escalation from judgeStatus**\n\nWhen the selected role is Judge and it returns the valid `{judgeStatus: \"escalate\"}` verdict, this classifier only examines `details.status` and therefore records the attempt as `accepted_receipt` rather than `role_escalation`. The post-settlement snapshot loses the exceptional outcome that should guide Navigator and status consumers; classify the Judge-specific field in addition to the common `status` envelopes.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.",
