      "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Persist the recovered role attempt as the latest settlement**\n\nFor an abandoned selected-role invocation, recovery synthesizes an `outcome_unavailable_after_runner_loss` attempt only in the immediate acquisition snapshot; it is not stored in `recovered` or a `role_settled` generation. Subsequent calls reconstruct `latest` exclusively from `role_settled`, so the recovered attempt disappears and Navigator is reconsulted as though that lost role attempt never occurred. Persist the synthesized attempt in the durable settlement state used by later acquisitions.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.",
