      "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Decode evidence pages without splitting UTF-8 characters**\n\nEvidence pagination slices arbitrary byte ranges and decodes each slice independently with `fatal: true`, so valid UTF-8 evidence becomes unreadable whenever a multibyte character crosses the requested or default page boundary—for example a one-byte page over `é`. The code also marks those bytes as read before decoding throws. Choose code-point-safe page boundaries or return an encoding that supports arbitrary byte slices, and update coverage only after a successful read.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.",
