      "body": "**<sub><sub>![P1 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P1-orange?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Reject an active call before publishing call_started**\n\nThe single-active-call check exists only in the conflict-retry path, so a staggered second caller that starts after the first `call_started` generation is already committed encounters no filesystem conflict and appends another `call_started` normally. If the first caller is still acquiring or is between invocations, `unresolved(rows)` is also null and both calls can proceed to consultations and role launches. Check the ledger for any incomplete call before every new `call_started` publication, not only after a generation race.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.",
